Acknowledgement
I would like to express my deepest gratitude to my supervisor, Dr. Sparsh Mittal, for his constant
support, guidance, and encouragement throughout my M.Tech journey. His mentorship has had a
profound impact on both my research journey and personal growth. He continuously motivated
me to pursue research with curiosity, sincerity, and confidence, even during the most difficult
phases of this journey. He always kept his door open for me in every situation, offering guidance,
support, and encouragement whenever I needed it most. His trust, encouragement, and belief in
my potential gave me the confidence to grow. I feel truly fortunate and grateful to have had Dr.
Sparsh Mittal as my supervisor.
During this journey, I had the opportunity to work with many talented individuals, and these
collaborations greatly enriched my research experience. I would especially like to thank Arnav
Singh, B.Tech CSE student at IIT Kharagpur, for our collaboration on the k-Sparse Audio Attack
project. I am also thankful to Swadesh Swain, B.Tech ECE student at IIT Roorkee, for his valuable
support and contribution to RN-Attack.
Finally, I sincerely thank everyone who directly or indirectly supported, encouraged, and stood by
me throughout this journey.
